publicName: JunkMaster
oneLiner: Sells gray junk at vendors and keeps a ledger of what was sold.
icon: icon.png

---

Gray items with a vendor price sell when you open a vendor. Gray items with nothing to sell for stay in your bags. When the selling finishes, chat reports how many items sold and what they were worth.

The ledger lists each sale and what it was worth. Buying an item back removes that sale. Slow, medium, and fast change how quickly the bags empty.

## Features

- Gray items with a vendor price sell when you open a vendor.
- Gray items with nothing to sell for stay in your bags.
- Chat reports how many items sold and what they were worth.
- The ledger lists each sale and what it was worth.
- Buying an item back removes that sale from the ledger.
- Choose slow, medium, or fast.

## Commands

- `/jm` or `/junkmaster` opens the ledger.
- `/jm slow`, `/jm medium`, or `/jm fast` sets how fast junk sells.
- `/jm reset` clears the ledger.
